41
00:02:43,190 --> 00:02:47,000
# Medical Certificate
For Mr. Roberto Hongo #

42
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:54,720
Hey, Roberto.

43
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:58,870
Did you bring the jersey you wore on the Brazilian national team?

44
00:02:58,870 --> 00:02:59,680
What?

45
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:03,630
I want to see the actual jersey you wore.

46
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:06,330
Alright.

47
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:10,650
Wow, amazing!

48
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,110
Number 10!

49
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:14,840
Look at that, Mom! It's real!

50
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:17,030
It looks so cool.

51
00:03:17,750 --> 00:03:19,080
By the way, Roberto...

52
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:21,460
...have you washed this?

53
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,000
Of course I washed it.

54
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:25,110
Roberto!

55
00:03:26,110 --> 00:03:29,400
I'll take on the world with the best Japanese team.

56
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:32,190
Even Brazil won't be able to stop me.

57
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:33,940
Big words.

58
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:37,280
I won't forget those words.

59
00:03:37,630 --> 00:03:38,560
Okay!

60
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:45,080
The world, huh.

61
00:03:45,220 --> 00:03:47,800
# Medical Certificate
For Mr. Roberto Hongo #

62
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:54,910
Good morning.

63
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:58,310
What?! The soccer club won a match?!

64
00:04:00,870 --> 00:04:02,870
How about you check the scores yourself?!

65
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,560
It's true!

66
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:06,520
You beat Nishigaoka Elementary 5-2?!

67
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,680
Awesome!

68
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:10,840
How did your lousy soccer club score 5 goals?

69
00:04:12,630 --> 00:04:14,680
Good you asked!

70
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:17,270
Our new club member...

71
00:04:17,430 --> 00:04:19,750
...Ozora Tsubasa scored 4 goals all by himself!

72
00:04:20,270 --> 00:04:22,630
And I scored the 5th goal!

73
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:27,430
I scored an amazing header.

74
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,310
Although it was thanks to Tsubasa-kun's cross.

75
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:33,800
Wait, wait. Who is this Tsubasa?

76
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:36,390
When did you get a new member?

77
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,510
About that...

78
00:04:37,870 --> 00:04:41,680
...we met by a twist of fate during spring break.

79
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:44,600
Fate? What are you talking about?

80
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:47,600
I mean, without this Tsubasa...

81
00:04:47,750 --> 00:04:49,270
...you wouldn't have scored any goals.

82
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:53,680
One person scoring four goals is even better than a hat trick.

83
00:04:53,830 --> 00:04:56,160
Even at Shutetsu, there's no one like that.

84
00:04:56,470 --> 00:04:58,870
We're not done surprising you.

85
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,380
Our soccer club has a new coach.

86
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:02,940
Yes, that's right.

87
00:05:03,110 --> 00:05:07,470
Our coach is Roberto Hongo, a former player of the Brazilian national team.

88
00:05:08,190 --> 00:05:09,430
Brazilian national team?!

89
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:13,390
Isn't that awesome?! He's an acquaintance of Tsubasa!

90
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:16,390
What kind of person is this Ozora Tsubasa?

91
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,190
Look, it's Tsubasa.

92
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:24,920
Is that Tsubasa?

93
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:27,310
Yes, Ozora Tsubasa.

94
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,830
Why is he dribbling?

95
00:05:30,230 --> 00:05:33,230
That's how he is. He must have dribbled all the way from home.

96
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:34,640
From home all the way here?!

97
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,110
He's always like this.

98
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:38,800
He goes everywhere dribbling the ball.

99
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,360
What?

100
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,470
That's really good.

101
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:44,720
It must be true that he scored 5 goals.

102
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,830
He looks like someone who could do that.

103
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,800
I scored one of those.

104
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:50,830
He only scored 4 goals.

105
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:53,600
Hey, Tsubasa!

106
00:05:54,190 --> 00:05:56,230
Ishizaki-kun, good morning!

107
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,870
6th Grade, Class 1

108
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:05,190
# Ozora Tsubasa #

109
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:10,390
Starting today, Ozora Tsubasa-kun will be joining this class as your classmate.

110
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,680
Everyone, please get along with him.

111
00:06:13,110 --> 00:06:16,270
My name is Ozora Tsubasa. Let's get along!

112
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,830
By the way...

113
00:06:19,630 --> 00:06:23,040
...why did you bring that soccer ball?

114
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,870
He's my friend.

115
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:27,270
Your friend?

116
00:06:27,470 --> 00:06:28,160
Yes!

117
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:31,870
Sensei, Tsubasa joined the soccer club.

118
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:34,800
This year, the soccer club will be very different from before!

119
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,870
The interschool tournament will be amazing!

120
00:06:37,230 --> 00:06:40,270
Cheer captain, we're counting on you for the cheering.

121
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:43,310
Is it really a good idea to aim that high?

122
00:06:43,470 --> 00:06:45,360
Isn't it just Tsubasa-kun who's amazing?

123
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:48,360
The rest are just the useless ones from the soccer club.

124
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,800
Not at all.

125
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,160
Both Ishizaki-kun and everyone else...

126
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:56,230
...will become better friends with the ball by the interschool tournament...

127
00:06:56,470 --> 00:06:59,470
...and become better at soccer, Roberto said.

128
00:07:00,110 --> 00:07:02,070
He said "friend" again.

129
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:03,110
Alright!

130
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:07,110
Then after school, let's go watch the soccer club's practice!

131
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:08,040
Okay!

132
00:07:09,390 --> 00:07:10,750
Well...

133
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:13,920
But the entrance ceremony was about to start.

134
00:07:15,390 --> 00:07:17,510
Nankatsu Elementary School students.

135
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:22,110
Especially those in the 4th grade and above in sports clubs...

136
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:26,310
...were eagerly waiting for today's entrance ceremony to end.

137
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:30,040
Starting today, they would begin preparing hard...

138
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:33,270
...for the tournament against Shutetsu Elementary.

139
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,630
- Don't slack off!
- Okay!

140
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:41,000
This year, the baseball club will win the interschool tournament for the third year in a row!

141
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,600
Yes!

142
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,720
We, the kendo club...

143
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:47,680
...will wipe away last year's shame!

144
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,160
Don't give up! Keep running!

145
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:53,470
The interschool tournament is near! No slacking off!

146
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,830
The interschool tournament...

147
00:07:56,430 --> 00:08:01,060
is a day-long sports festival in which all clubs of the two elementary schools in town,...

148
00:08:01,060 --> 00:08:06,360
...Nankatsu Elementary and Shutetsu Elementary, participate.

149
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:09,110
With the 26th tournament just around the corner...

150
00:08:09,270 --> 00:08:14,270
...there was a perfect tie with twelve wins each and one draw.

151
00:08:09,630 --> 00:08:14,270
SHUUTETSU                                  NANKATSU

152
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:15,000
Twelve Wins Each, One Draw

153
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:16,390
# Nankatsu Will Win #

154
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,870
One, two! One, two!

155
00:08:19,270 --> 00:08:21,830
We'll finally get a decisive lead this year.

156
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:24,430
Every club is extremely fired up.

157
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,870
Right, Anego?

158
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:29,040
TN: Anego: feminine form of Aniki, meaning big sister/boss lady.

159
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:29,040
The main problem is the soccer club.

160
00:08:29,430 --> 00:08:32,670
Let's go, Anego. Let's see how talented Tsubasa really is.

161
00:08:32,910 --> 00:08:35,360
Alright, let's go to the soccer field!

162
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,600
Okay!

163
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:45,030
Oh man, Roberto left this out in the open.

164
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:50,550
Ace forward, number 10, Roberto Hongo.

165
00:08:51,420 --> 00:08:54,720
Not exactly Tsubasa, but a cool guy.

166
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:57,550
There was cleaning duty.

167
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,850
No way.

168
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:09,570
# Medical Certificate
For Mr. Roberto Hongo #

169
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:09,570
Ophthalmology?

170
00:09:11,650 --> 00:09:13,190
Roberto, I'm sorry.

171
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,410
What does this mean?

172
00:09:26,580 --> 00:09:28,130
Roberto...

173
00:09:28,130 --> 00:09:29,380
It can't be.

174
00:09:35,390 --> 00:09:39,120
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

175
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:44,200
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

176
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:54,780
What nice weather.

177
00:09:58,530 --> 00:10:00,950
Dear Coach João,

178
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:03,450
It really didn't work out.

179
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,960
I did my best...

180
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,790
...and on the advice of Captain Ozora,...

181
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:10,420
...I finally returned to Japan.

182
00:10:11,420 --> 00:10:13,960
But according to the diagnosis,...

183
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,470
...I have a detached retina.

184
00:10:16,090 --> 00:10:18,300
It's true we noticed it late.

185
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:20,720
If I continue playing football...

186
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:27,310
...a heavy impact during a match...

187
00:10:28,190 --> 00:10:32,110
...could blind me forever.

188
00:10:34,690 --> 00:10:37,740
Please announce my retirement.

189
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:40,990
I plan to stay in Japan for a while longer.

190
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:46,160
Roberto Hongo of the Brazilian national team, dribbling so stylishly!

191
00:10:47,290 --> 00:10:50,580
No, I can no longer play football.

192
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:55,090
In this situation, it may be best for me to stay in my homeland, Japan.

193
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:58,090
Don't worry about me.

194
00:10:59,470 --> 00:11:04,140
I've been preparing myself for this ever since I left Brazil.

195
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:12,400
But if one day I return to Brazil...

196
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,360
...then...

197
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:16,400
...I feel I won't be alone.

198
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:21,530
I found a new spark in my homeland, Japan.

199
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:23,740
Everyone, let's start practice.

200
00:11:23,740 --> 00:11:24,870
Yes!

201
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:28,290
The name of that spark is Ozora Tsubasa.

202
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:31,620
- Roberto!
- Coach!

203
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:35,210
Alright. Let's do this.

204
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:37,880
Roberto!

205
00:11:46,510 --> 00:11:48,890
A-Amazing...

206
00:11:50,190 --> 00:11:52,190
Nice shot, Roberto.

207
00:11:52,190 --> 00:11:54,110
Nice control, Tsubasa.

208
00:11:55,730 --> 00:11:56,940
Amazing!

209
00:11:56,940 --> 00:11:59,240
Did you see? Did you see? Did you see that just now?

210
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:01,070
Y-Yes...

211
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:02,780
Tsubasa is amazing too, but...

212
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:06,200
...that uncle isn't bad either. Especially that shot.

213
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,040
He's their coach?

214
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:11,460
The Brazilian player Ishizaki was talking about.

215
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:14,170
What was it, Hongo something.

216
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:16,340
Roberto Hongo.

217
00:12:16,340 --> 00:12:19,130
You're talking about a Brazilian national team player.

218
00:12:19,130 --> 00:12:20,880
Though he's a former player.

219
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:22,840
Who are you?

220
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:25,010
Nankatsu's cheer squad.

221
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:27,970
I'm Nakazawa Sanae.

222
00:12:27,970 --> 00:12:30,560
I'm the captain of the Nankatsu Elementary cheer squad.

223
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:32,060
Everyone calls me Anego.

224
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:34,190
You didn't have to say that!

225
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:38,690
So, did you come to support the soccer club?

226
00:12:38,690 --> 00:12:39,650
No.

227
00:12:39,650 --> 00:12:42,860
Actually, I heard from Ishizaki that you beat Nishigaoka Elementary in yesterday's match...

228
00:12:42,860 --> 00:12:46,620
...and we came because we were curious about Tsubasa and you guys.

229
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:52,500
Ishizaki said our lousy soccer team would undergo a huge change.

230
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:54,920
We came to see what kind of change it is.

231
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:02,630
Okay. Then let's start with a match first.

232
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:03,840
A match?

233
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:07,100
A welcome party for Tsubasa.

234
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:18,110
This is a welcome party?

235
00:13:18,110 --> 00:13:20,570
It'll be the exact opposite of when I first met Tsubasa.

236
00:13:20,570 --> 00:13:23,860
From the one between him and Shutetsu's B team.

237
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:26,490
Tsubasa will attack alone.

238
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:29,870
Ishizaki's group will pass and try to contain Tsubasa.

239
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:33,040
Meaning, you must not let him take the ball from you.

240
00:13:33,410 --> 00:13:35,670
If Tsubasa gets the ball, he'll shoot.

241
00:13:35,670 --> 00:13:37,880
Time limit is 5 minutes.

242
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:40,460
If the shot scores, Tsubasa wins.

243
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:44,260
If you can prevent it from becoming a goal for 5 minutes, Ishizaki's group wins.

244
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,380
Okay!

245
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:47,470
Isn't this a crazy game?

246
00:13:47,470 --> 00:13:50,260
Even if it's Tsubasa, isn't it too hard alone?

247
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:52,640
Shut up and watch.

248
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:57,100
We're going to play against Tsubasa-kun.

249
00:13:57,100 --> 00:13:59,270
He'll take the ball right away.

250
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:01,770
What cowards you turned out to be!

251
00:14:01,770 --> 00:14:04,150
If he takes it, you take it back.

252
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:06,280
Won't it be amazing to play against Tsubasa?

253
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:08,570
Ishizaki, you're too optimistic.

254
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:12,120
Against Tsubasa we... Let's do this!

255
00:14:12,870 --> 00:14:14,910
Tsubasa, bring it on!

256
00:14:14,910 --> 00:14:16,920
I'm coming, everyone!

257
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:26,260
Begin!

258
00:14:27,380 --> 00:14:30,640
He's coming! Nagano, mark Tsubasa!

259
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:31,640
Okay!

260
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:37,020
Sorry, Tsubasa.

261
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:39,650
For the next 5 minutes, we'll mark you.

262
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:45,570
He got past!

263
00:14:45,570 --> 00:14:47,820
Hey, hey! It's wide open!

264
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:49,240
Oda!

265
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:55,040
Nakazato!

266
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,120
Oh no!

267
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,790
Damn...

268
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:03,750
I'm leaving it to you, take this!

269
00:15:03,750 --> 00:15:05,420
Got it!

270
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:09,630
Too fast!

271
00:15:13,850 --> 00:15:15,810
Guys, stop Tsubasa!

272
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,570
So strong.

273
00:15:24,570 --> 00:15:27,320
Ishizaki's group is no match for him.

274
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:29,740
Anego, he's really talented.

275
00:15:29,740 --> 00:15:32,570
It's like the ball is part of his body.

276
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:36,330
Last 3 minutes.

277
00:15:36,330 --> 00:15:38,290
We still have time!

278
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:40,540
Everyone, get the ball back!

279
00:15:40,540 --> 00:15:42,880
We can't disappoint Roberto!

280
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,880
- Okay!
- Got it.

281
00:15:51,470 --> 00:15:53,340
Manabu, come on.

282
00:15:53,340 --> 00:15:55,100
Last one minute.

283
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,440
That's it.

284
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:05,190
Everyone's movements have changed.

285
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:09,690
By practicing with Tsubasa, everyone will improve quickly.

286
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:14,700
The coach knew that, so he put us against him.

287
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:19,080
That's right. At this rate, we'll win the interschool tournament!

288
00:16:27,090 --> 00:16:28,960
Go!

289
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:35,550
It went in!

290
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:37,810
It's over.

291
00:16:49,940 --> 00:16:52,570
Man... We lost.

292
00:16:52,570 --> 00:16:55,820
Tsubasa-kun is truly amazing.

293
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:59,580
Tsubasa, you always have a solid shot.

294
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,960
Because I love football.

295
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:07,960
What happened just now, Anego?

296
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,800
Did your tongue get tied?

297
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:11,760
I've never seen Anego like this.

298
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:13,510
Anego? Hey!

299
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,090
He...

300
00:17:17,890 --> 00:17:19,760
...is so cool!

301
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:23,890
Anego turned into a girl!

302
00:17:23,890 --> 00:17:25,650
Everyone, good job.

303
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:29,400
You were good at containing Tsubasa.

304
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:32,400
From now on, you'll do as I say.

305
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:34,070
- Okay?
- Okay!

306
00:17:42,250 --> 00:17:43,040
Shoot!

307
00:17:58,930 --> 00:18:00,720
Any news?

308
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:03,850
Yes, under Roberto Hongo's coaching...

309
00:18:03,850 --> 00:18:06,520
...they've started practicing seriously.

310
00:18:06,850 --> 00:18:11,520
I can't wait to see how much Ozora Tsubasa will progress under Roberto Hongo.

311
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:12,940
The other players don't matter.

312
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,990
The other players are irrelevant.

313
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:22,040
Against Nishigaoka, only Tsubasa showed anything.

314
00:18:22,490 --> 00:18:24,410
Don't underestimate them.

315
00:18:25,870 --> 00:18:29,630
Still, the only one who can match me is Tsubasa!

316
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:37,760
What a tough practice.

317
00:18:37,760 --> 00:18:41,140
The Brazilian coach really pushes them hard.

318
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:43,510
It was tiring just to watch.

319
00:18:43,510 --> 00:18:45,390
I'm out of water!

320
00:18:45,390 --> 00:18:47,480
I can't move.

321
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:50,610
Hey! What whiners you turned out to be!

322
00:18:50,610 --> 00:18:52,570
What are you saying, Anego?

323
00:18:52,570 --> 00:18:54,030
Look at Tsubasa-kun.

324
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:56,570
He's still lively.

325
00:18:56,570 --> 00:18:59,530
Tsubasa is different from us!

326
00:18:59,530 --> 00:19:03,030
That's why everyone calls you a lousy soccer team.

327
00:19:03,030 --> 00:19:05,290
I thought you had changed!

328
00:19:05,290 --> 00:19:08,580
Calm down, calm down. Change takes time.

329
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:09,790
Be patient.

330
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:11,500
I can't be patient!

331
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:13,710
The interschool tournament is about to start!

332
00:19:13,710 --> 00:19:16,550
You're right. It's about to start. That's why everyone...

333
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:18,420
...to win the interschool tournament...

334
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:21,340
...you must become friends with the soccer ball.

335
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:25,220
Tsubasa and the coach always say "friend."

336
00:19:25,220 --> 00:19:27,520
How do we become friends with the ball?

337
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,850
Always be with it.

338
00:19:29,850 --> 00:19:32,730
When you go to school, when you eat...

339
00:19:32,730 --> 00:19:35,730
...always be with the soccer ball.

340
00:19:36,530 --> 00:19:39,650
Does Tsubasa always do that too?

341
00:19:39,650 --> 00:19:41,030
Yes, more or less.

342
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:44,030
So you dribble all the way to school?

343
00:19:44,030 --> 00:19:45,290
Yes.

344
00:19:45,290 --> 00:19:49,040
Tsubasa didn't learn this from me.

345
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:51,790
He's been doing it since he was little.

346
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,920
From now on, you cannot use your hands.

347
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:59,340
A soccer ball is not something to carry with your hands.

348
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:00,880
No way!

349
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:05,470
We can't just dribble everywhere we go like Tsubasa!

350
00:20:05,850 --> 00:20:07,470
You can, everyone.

351
00:20:07,470 --> 00:20:09,180
Yes, you must!

352
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:10,850
Easy to say!

353
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:12,480
Don't you want to get better?

354
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:15,020
What about goalkeepers?

355
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:17,980
It's the same for goalkeepers but...

356
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:20,240
...it's okay for you to use your hands.

357
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:22,780
- Hooray!
- That's not fair!

358
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:24,910
That's it for today then.

359
00:20:24,910 --> 00:20:27,540
Everyone, dribble on your way home.

360
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:30,660
What?!

361
00:20:30,660 --> 00:20:32,920
See you, Tsubasa.

362
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:35,420
See you tomorrow.

363
00:20:35,420 --> 00:20:37,750
Be careful, everyone.

